&lt;h2 id="あらすじ"&gt;あらすじ&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A remake version of &lt;a href="https://yinghu.netlify.app/v6931"&gt;Bibou &lt;del&gt;Vintage&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The differences include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;totally different scripts&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;a short opening&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;multiple endings&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;a new side-story made by the Ecchi V Cinema master &lt;a href="https://yinghu.netlify.app/s14993"&gt;Okano Yuuki&lt;/a&gt; that explodes in the crotch&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;animated scenes by a lead animator.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
